.TH L10N-LINT-GTK 1 "February 2026" "l10n-lint-gtk 1.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
l10n-lint-gtk \- GTK graphical interface for l10n-lint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-lint-gtk
[\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B l10n-lint-gtk
is a modern GTK4/libadwaita graphical frontend for the l10n-lint localization
file linter. It provides a user-friendly interface for checking gettext .po
and Qt .ts files for common issues.
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Sidebar history
Recent files are saved and can be quickly accessed from the sidebar.
.TP
.B Filter bar
Filter issues by severity (error, warning, info) or search text.
.TP
.B Statistics panel
View translation statistics: files, entries, translated, untranslated, fuzzy.
.TP
.B Export reports
Export lint results as HTML, JSON, or plain text.
.TP
.B Preferences
Configure linting options like maximum length and strict mode.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+O
Open file
.TP
.B Ctrl+Return
Run linter
.TP
.B Ctrl+E
Export report
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR l10n-lint (1)
